Estatuto Nacional da Microempresa e da Empresa de Pequeno Porte (Lei Complementar 123/2006) verified 2026-10-31: replay of Planalto's annotated page (13 versions) against the unstruck text of its page (no consolidated page published): 0 differences, 0 problems. The page is the act as republished under LC 139/2011 art. 5 (DOU 31.1.2012 and 6.3.2012) and notes changes only from LC 147/2014, so the history starts on 6.3.2012 with the oldest version available (first_law null, earlier_laws LC 123/2006); the 2006 text and the 2007-2011 changes are not modelled. Hand: days for LC 188/2021 (heading lacks 'DE'), LC 155/2016 (letter-spaced clause; in force on publication, effects deferred) and LC 216/2025 (art. 8 II); LC 155's letter-spaced title replaced by its ementa; arts. 18-C, 38-A, 85-A unnoted lines kept in the base text (the inserted-article rule misfired: their caput has no 'Incluído' note); art. 18 '§ 1º A.' filed as § 1º-A; bare 'd)'/'e)' lines with only 'Vide LC 214' pointers left out; heading lines set in <h1>/<h2> read as headings; LC 214/2025 art. 543 V partial repeal of 23 listed dispositivos (with the lines below them) on 1.1.2033 (futuro). Open items: Anexos I-V not included; LC 214/227 changes shown only as 'Vide' pointers not modelled. Duplicate checks flag only '(REVOGADO)' placeholders, the § 1º/§ 1º-A label and repeated alíneas under different incisos (legitimate); note-leak only revogado placeholders; first-line clean; parse twice identical (sha256 b81541e9); merged scratch build 112 acts, 2049 versions, 1732 commits, check.py 0 mismatches, 0 trailer errors, --compare identical, audit_push clean on main and futuro.
